                Experience Calculator is provided for informational purposes only. While we strive for
                accurate calculations, we do not guarantee that results are error-free or suitable for any
                specific legal, financial, or official purpose. Always verify important figures independently.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">No Warranty</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">
                This website is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied,
                including but not limited to accuracy, reliability, or availability of the service.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                We are not liable for any damages or losses resulting from the use of, or inability to use,
                this website or the calculations it provides.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>